@FarmConnect.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5097

### Get all products
GET {{FarmConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Get one product
GET {{FarmConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Get a missing product
GET {{FarmConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/999
Accept: application/json

### Create a product
POST {{FarmConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fresh Tomatoes",
  "price": 60,
  "stock": 20
}
